// PAN-OS Management Auth From Unexpected Source  (CVE-2026-0322)
// Source rule: ../sigma/pan_os_mgmt_auth_from_unexpected_source.yml
// SCHEMA: Elastic PAN-OS integration / Filebeat panw module (ECS).
// Rule type: Query (KQL) | Index: logs-panw.panos-*
// NOTE: detects UNEXPECTED management auth - NOT proof CVE-2026-0322 was used.
//   KQL supports CIDR subnet matching on ip fields (source.ip:"10.0.0.0/8").
// TUNE: replace the allowlist subnet(s) with your admin jump-box CIDRs.

event.module:"panw" and event.dataset:"panw.panos"
  and panw.panos.sub_type:"auth"
  and event.outcome:"success"
  and not source.ip:"10.0.0.0/8"
